# Line endings.
#
# Without this file each contributor's core.autocrlf decides what lands in the
# index, so the same file can arrive as LF from one machine and CRLF from the
# next. text=auto stores every text file as LF in the repository and checks it
# out with the platform's native endings, which keeps diffs to the lines that
# actually changed.
* text=auto

# Binary: never eol-convert these, and never try to diff them as text.
# The model weights are gitignored, but a forced add must not corrupt them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pt   binary
*.pth  binary
